{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "fitclub-enterprise-api-v1-master",
		"name": "FIT CLUB Platform - Master Enterprise API Collection (v1.0)",
		"description": "# 🏋️ FIT CLUB Platform - Master RESTful API Collection\n\n> **Enterprise Clean Architecture & Mobile/Web Integration Standard**\n\nWelcome to the official API documentation and interactive collection for **FIT CLUB Gym Management Platform**.\n\n---\n\n## 🌐 Environments & Base URLs\n- **Localhost Development:** `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1`\n- **Production Cloud:** `https://fitclub.laravel.cloud/api/v1`\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Authentication (Laravel Sanctum)\nAll protected endpoints require a Bearer token in the `Authorization` header:\n```http\nAuthorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}\nAccept: application/json\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n> **⚡ Automatic Token Extraction:** When you execute `POST /register` or `POST /login`, this Postman collection automatically intercepts the returned token and saves it to the `{{bearer_token}}` variable. You can immediately call all protected endpoints with zero manual copy-pasting!\n\n---\n\n## 🛡️ Security Rate Limiting\n- **Login Attempts (`throttle:login`):** 5 requests / min (`HTTP 429` on breach)\n- **Global APIs (`throttle:api`):** 60 requests / min\n- **Real-Time Chat Messages (`throttle:chat`):** 30 messages / min",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "bearer_token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{bearer_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "01. Public & Landing Page (Home, Coaches, Plans)",
			"description": "Public endpoints accessible by anyone without authentication. Used to populate the landing page, team showcases, operating hours, and gym code of conduct.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Consolidated Landing Page Payload",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "string" }],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/landing",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "landing"]
						},
						"description": "Returns the complete landing page package in a single high-speed call including Hero copy, live stats, active subscription plans, schedules, and gym rules."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Public Certified Trainers Showcase",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "string" }],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/trainers",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "trainers"]
						},
						"description": "Retrieves the public directory of certified coaches with avatars, biographies, specialties, session pricing, and verified certificates."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Public Active Plans",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "string" }],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/plans",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "plans"]
						},
						"description": "Lists all active membership plans with pricing, duration, and full perk quotas (PT sessions, InBody, Kickboxing, Freeze days)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Gym Operating Schedules",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "string" }],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/schedules",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "schedules"]
